<title>HUNGARY: Styl H1 after-tax 135.1 mln vs 111.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Styl H1 after-tax 135.1 mln vs 111.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Jan-June 1997    Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating profit	  134.4     vs     189.7</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    153.5     vs     143.4</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	  135.1     vs     111.9</p>
<p>    Net sales		 1,751.3     vs   1,415.9</p>
<p>	Domestic sales	  433.6     vs     289.3</p>
<p>	Export sales	  1,317.7     vs   1,126.6</p>
<p>    Other revenue		20.5     vs	36.9</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales   796.3     vs     616.1</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales 765.6     vs     551.1</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	 75.6     vs	95.9</p>
<p>    Net financial income     24.2 profit vs   50.6 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	28.6     vs	68.0</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure   4.5     vs     118.5</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income  5.1 loss vs	4.2 profit</p>
<p>    Taxation		     18.4     vs	31.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Styl Ruhagyar Rt is a garment factory. The figures are unaudited,  were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
